    },
    "body": "**Problem:** CI downloads and uses lint binaries, macOS and FreeBSD SDK archives, LLVM, IWYU, and RISC-V source trees, and the LLVM APT signing key.\r\nThe downloaded files are not verified, and Git branch or tag names can resolve to unreviewed commits.\r\n\r\n**Fix:** Verify downloaded files against pinned SHA256 hashes and clone Git sources at reviewed commits before use.\r\n",
